@startuml
title D-04 Degraded Resolve and Continuity Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Parker
actor "Supervisor / Operator" as Supervisor
participant "Payment Channel" as Channel
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Vendor PMS / HCP" as Vendor
database "Parking Session Projection" as Projection
participant "ExitPass Continuity" as Continuity
participant "Assisted Payment Terminal\nContinuity Mode" as Terminal
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Gate / Exit" as Gate

Parker -> Channel : lookup / payment attempt
Channel -> Central : request resolve
Central -> Vendor : live resolve attempt
Vendor --> Central : unavailable / degraded
Central -> Projection : check latest projection and freshness

alt projection fresh, unambiguous, and controls active
  Central -> Continuity : enter degraded resolve with audit tag
  Continuity -> Supervisor : require activation / recognition policy
  Supervisor --> Continuity : approve where required
  Continuity -> Central : approved degraded context
  Central -> Central : use approved tariff configuration
  Central -> POS : request fiscal issuance if payment finality exists
  POS --> Central : fiscal document identity / status
  Central -> Gate : issue ExitAuthorization if eligible
else stale, ambiguous, or insufficient data
  Central -> Central : fail closed
  Central --> Channel : payment / exit not available; escalate
  Supervisor -> Terminal : optional controlled continuity process
end

note over Projection
Projection is operational visibility and degraded support.
It is not financial truth, payment finality, or exit authorization.
end note

@enduml
